            <ArticleTitle>Wound pain: the need for a more understanding approach.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>181-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Wound pain is hard to measure, and its treatment has suffered from a lack of knowledge on the part of health-care professionals. This paper describes current approaches, the mechanisms of pain and suggests strategies for improved care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
